tcad/data_extraction/runs/

# Model-artifact policy: ignore generated datasets, trials, plots, and
# checkpoints by default. Only the finalized runtime packages below are
# allowlisted so a fresh clone can run frontend/app.py without local data.
ai/model_artifacts/*
!ai/model_artifacts/README.md

!ai/model_artifacts/curve_model/
ai/model_artifacts/curve_model/*
